                                   "title":  "The Honjin Murders by Seishi Yokomizo | Goodreads",
                                   "snippet":  "Pushkin Vertigo has done it again, this time with the classic Japanese mystery, The Honjin Murders, the first book to feature Yokomizo\u0027s \"scruffy-looking\" sleuth Kosuke Kindaichi. Making his debut in 1946, he would go on to solve a further 76 cases over the next thirty-plus years before his creator\u0027s death in 1981.",
